WEBVTT

00:00.270 --> 00:10.400
Tsuki no kaasu tsumetai yume no naka de

00:00.270 --> 00:10.400
Under the moon’s curse, inside of a cold dream…

00:18.910 --> 00:25.290
Kotoba no nai sekai de bokura wa ai wo kataru

00:18.910 --> 00:25.290
In a world without words, we speak of love

00:25.290 --> 00:29.250
itsuka kimi ni todoku made

00:25.290 --> 00:29.250
until it reaches you someday.

00:32.090 --> 00:38.970
Kizu darake no kaina de dakiyoseta kuchibiru no

00:32.090 --> 00:38.970
I want to melt the frozen over wish...

00:38.970 --> 00:44.640
haritsumeta negai tokashitakute

00:38.970 --> 00:44.640
from the lips that I embraced with arms covered in wounds.

00:44.890 --> 00:51.610
Nee, aishiatta kako no utsukushisa sutesareba

00:44.890 --> 00:51.610
Hey, if I abandon the beauty of the past when we loved each other,

00:51.990 --> 00:57.780
ashita motto kirei na yoru e yukeru kara

00:51.990 --> 00:57.780
then tomorrow, I can go to a more beautiful night.

00:58.160 --> 01:06.330
Tsuki no kaasu tsumetai yume no naka kara

00:58.160 --> 01:06.330
Under the moon’s curse, from inside of a cold dream.

01:06.330 --> 01:13.010
Kimi wo tooku tsuresaritakute

01:06.330 --> 01:13.010
I want to take you somewhere far away,

01:13.010 --> 01:16.430
doko made yukeru

01:13.010 --> 01:16.430
and go anywhere,

01:16.430 --> 01:24.020
ai wo shinjite ii basho made

01:16.430 --> 01:24.020
to a place where we can believe in love.

01:38.280 --> 01:39.360
Soubi!

01:46.420 --> 01:47.430
Don't touch me.

01:49.010 --> 01:50.210
You'll get dirty.

01:56.390 --> 01:58.050
Hey, Doctor...

01:58.430 --> 01:59.200
Hm?

01:59.970 --> 02:01.890
True friends...

02:06.370 --> 02:11.110
...wouldn't lie or hide important
things from me, right?

02:13.080 --> 02:15.750
You don't lie?

02:17.410 --> 02:20.020
Do you tell everything to your friends?

02:20.710 --> 02:22.930
Not everything, but...

02:23.680 --> 02:25.040
...I don't lie.

02:25.540 --> 02:26.550
Oh?

02:26.550 --> 02:31.700
By friends, do you mean that girl from
your class you mentioned before?

02:31.700 --> 02:33.040
Um? No.

02:33.970 --> 02:34.970
I see.

02:34.970 --> 02:39.010
Well, it's normal to lie
to the person you like...

02:40.220 --> 02:41.230
Why?

02:41.230 --> 02:42.010
Well...

02:42.600 --> 02:47.480
They want a nice guy like you to
have a good impression of them, right?

02:48.020 --> 02:50.160
That's why they lie.

02:52.780 --> 02:54.770
They don't mean any harm.

02:55.410 --> 02:57.440
They lie because they like you.

02:58.200 --> 02:59.430
Because they like me...

03:00.370 --> 03:05.840
People lie to hurt you,
or because they like you.

03:06.560 --> 03:11.290
The important thing is what
that friend means to you.

03:15.360 --> 03:18.510
What is he to me?

03:19.490 --> 03:21.270
What am I to him?

03:25.800 --> 03:30.390
By the way, I've wanted to ask
you something for a while...

03:30.390 --> 03:31.350
Yes?

03:32.160 --> 03:34.860
How old are you?

03:37.300 --> 03:38.650
I'm 21.

03:39.450 --> 03:40.290
Huh?

03:43.220 --> 03:44.510
Listen, Soubi!

03:44.510 --> 03:46.580
We're gonna straighten out
what we know up to this point.

03:47.430 --> 03:48.040
Okay.

03:51.990 --> 03:57.500
According to Seimei's will,
"Septimal Moon" killed him.

03:58.790 --> 04:02.240
There is a Sentouki school
within "Septimal Moon"...

04:03.220 --> 04:08.530
...where a teacher sends people
like Breathless and Sleepless...

04:09.600 --> 04:13.060
...for some reason, they
gave me a coded message...

04:14.610 --> 04:16.940
...which I don't understand yet...

04:19.400 --> 04:23.240
Besides those two, they
also sent over Zero, right?

04:27.750 --> 04:28.880
Soubi!

04:32.260 --> 04:34.790
Your injury, does it still hurt?

04:37.940 --> 04:38.590
I'm fine.

04:42.470 --> 04:45.360
What is "Septimal Moon" anyway?

04:46.100 --> 04:47.920
What is that organization for?

04:48.520 --> 04:49.410
Who knows...

04:51.310 --> 04:56.870
But when you sort it out like this... it's easy to understand.

04:58.020 --> 04:59.200
Fine!

04:59.200 --> 05:00.630
I get it!

05:01.140 --> 05:05.750
If you tell me all that you know,
most of my questions will be answered!

05:06.120 --> 05:07.790
Ritsuka, you know that I...

05:07.790 --> 05:10.420
I know! You can't tell me, right?

05:10.420 --> 05:12.660
Fine! I won't ask you again!

05:13.580 --> 05:14.910
But, Soubi...

05:17.060 --> 05:20.840
I wont ask you to tell me about the
past, but tell me everything from now on!

05:21.920 --> 05:25.140
Don't fight on your own like last time!

05:25.140 --> 05:27.550
Report to me when you get hurt or sick!

05:31.440 --> 05:33.980
Don't ever hide anything from me!

05:34.440 --> 05:36.520
Is that an order?

05:36.520 --> 05:38.230
Yes! That's right, an order!

05:40.920 --> 05:41.770
I understand.

05:41.970 --> 05:43.260
Do you, really?

05:43.260 --> 05:43.860
Yes.

05:44.570 --> 05:46.060
You're not lying?

05:46.060 --> 05:49.410
No, I'm not lying!

05:49.750 --> 05:51.380
I'm serious!

05:51.380 --> 05:53.410
Are you sure you aren't lying?

05:53.750 --> 05:55.460
I'm sure I'm not lying...

05:57.300 --> 05:58.620
You're lying!

05:59.600 --> 06:00.590
Really.

06:01.000 --> 06:05.300
We'll be disposed of if we
go back to Professor Nagisa.

06:06.260 --> 06:09.640
We don't have any place to go back to.

06:13.140 --> 06:15.310
You guys are cute...

06:17.060 --> 06:19.020
You want to come to my place?

06:19.780 --> 06:21.730
To be honest, we were saved.

06:21.730 --> 06:22.630
Yeah.

06:23.240 --> 06:24.570
I see...

06:26.780 --> 06:30.180
Well, just be careful of Soubi.

06:30.870 --> 06:34.390
Contrary to his looks, he
has a thing for younger boys.

06:34.390 --> 06:36.110
Yeah, we know.

06:36.460 --> 06:38.460
Plus, he's quite a masochist.

06:44.920 --> 06:47.310
Kio, you're leaving already?

06:47.310 --> 06:48.050
Soubi...

06:48.850 --> 06:52.770
I have to go and take care
of my mother for a while.

06:53.480 --> 06:59.200
You won't be able to reach me for some time,
but don't you worry about me...

06:59.200 --> 07:00.630
Yeah, okay.

07:03.610 --> 07:06.380
Worry about me, too!

07:06.380 --> 07:06.820
Huh?

07:15.540 --> 07:17.040
Hey, Sakagami?

07:18.450 --> 07:20.710
Long time no see. How've you been?

07:22.300 --> 07:23.100
Hi.

07:23.100 --> 07:24.960
Let's go, Sakagami.

07:27.300 --> 07:29.550
What, Yamato's friend?

07:29.550 --> 07:31.940
Nah. We just went to
the same middle school.

07:39.610 --> 07:41.520
What's up, Yamato?

07:42.960 --> 07:44.230
Sakagami?

07:44.230 --> 07:47.230
Go now and crush Soubi Agatsuma!
I'm pretty upset. - Nagisa

07:47.360 --> 07:51.840
Go now and crush Soubi Agatsuma.

07:52.540 --> 07:54.910
I'm pretty upset.

08:13.000 --> 08:15.220
Why don't you take these fake ears off?

08:15.640 --> 08:18.390
Whatever. Who are those girls?

08:19.690 --> 08:22.140
We just hang out in school.

08:22.140 --> 08:25.400
How about you, walking
with a gloomy-looking girl?

08:26.360 --> 08:28.500
Just our home is in the same direction.

08:28.910 --> 08:29.870
I see...

08:30.530 --> 08:31.890
That's fine.

08:31.890 --> 08:34.180
Fine with me, too.

09:00.350 --> 09:01.780
He's here again.

09:05.640 --> 09:08.960
I don't want to see him...

09:09.610 --> 09:15.070
...but I want ask him about his
injury, and thank him for that day.

09:15.270 --> 09:17.320
I'm saying it's none of your business.

09:20.230 --> 09:26.710
He wants to see Aoyagi, and
it has nothing to do with me...

09:26.710 --> 09:27.460
Teacher!

09:28.380 --> 09:30.610
Where should we put these?

09:31.760 --> 09:34.010
Oh, please take it to the
social studies' reference room.

09:34.010 --> 09:34.920
Okay!

09:35.510 --> 09:36.600
Aoyagi.

09:36.600 --> 09:37.180
Yes?

09:37.180 --> 09:40.100
Um, Agatsuma's here.

09:40.730 --> 09:42.540
At the gate.

09:42.540 --> 09:44.000
I don't care.

09:44.430 --> 09:45.450
Let's go!

09:45.450 --> 09:46.790
Um, okay.

09:47.440 --> 09:50.310
I don't care, huh?

09:51.070 --> 09:53.400
If I could only say that...

10:12.880 --> 10:16.050
Ladies, why are you
so thirsty for blood?

10:16.680 --> 10:18.510
Cause we're really motivated!

10:19.300 --> 10:20.710
I'm not...

10:21.170 --> 10:22.970
I just fixed my glasses.

10:23.230 --> 10:24.750
We're not letting you go!

10:24.750 --> 10:26.930
We haven't come to fight.

10:27.270 --> 10:29.520
Our name is Zero.

10:31.610 --> 10:34.020
We came here to lynch you.

10:43.080 --> 10:44.670
Oh! Soubi!

10:45.540 --> 10:46.870
Hello!

10:47.330 --> 10:48.290
Yuiko.

10:49.750 --> 10:52.900
Ritsuka's helping out
our teacher right now.

10:53.720 --> 10:55.830
Well, tell him I said hi.

10:56.720 --> 10:58.840
Didn't you come to see him?

10:59.510 --> 11:01.750
Something suddenly came up. Bye-bye!

11:03.770 --> 11:05.120
That was strange...

11:06.480 --> 11:08.110
What was that?

11:08.110 --> 11:09.890
Big boobs!

11:10.280 --> 11:12.260
Is she really in grade school?

11:12.260 --> 11:13.600
Can't you tell by looking at her?

11:14.030 --> 11:16.410
Is that Ritsuka Aoyagi's girl?

11:16.410 --> 11:17.710
Why do you say that?

11:18.100 --> 11:20.070
I kinda thought she was...

11:20.790 --> 11:22.600
You're too imaginative.

11:22.600 --> 11:25.780
Yikes, your face is scary.

11:43.560 --> 11:44.480
Hey.

11:45.680 --> 11:47.640
Are you sure you're okay by yourself?

11:48.730 --> 11:50.850
You can call Ritsuka if you want to.

11:51.940 --> 11:54.230
Just hurry up and get it over with.

11:54.780 --> 11:57.320
Soubi? With high school girls?

11:57.700 --> 11:58.550
Uh-huh.

11:58.550 --> 12:03.950
One had the Sakuragaoka High School's
uniform and she didn't have ears.

12:03.950 --> 12:05.990
What? No ears?

12:09.540 --> 12:12.210
So, did something happen
between you and Soubi?

12:12.210 --> 12:13.500
Huh? Why?

12:13.860 --> 12:16.130
Both of you are acting strange.

12:16.800 --> 12:18.710
Are you okay?

12:20.930 --> 12:22.680
I'm fine.

12:24.400 --> 12:25.840
I'll try calling Soubi.

12:32.810 --> 12:34.070
Your phone.

12:34.070 --> 12:36.360
Yours is ringing too.

12:37.220 --> 12:38.800
From Professor Nagisa...

12:39.160 --> 12:41.400
Kouya, don't get confused.

12:48.830 --> 12:50.150
He hung up on me!

12:52.630 --> 12:55.350
He's doing something
behind my back again...

12:56.130 --> 12:58.250
He promised me!

12:58.590 --> 13:00.690
Soubi's not answering?

13:02.530 --> 13:04.560
I'm gonna go look for him!

13:05.090 --> 13:06.600
Oh, I'll go with you!

13:06.600 --> 13:08.980
No, it's better that I go alone.

13:08.980 --> 13:09.760
See ya!

13:18.820 --> 13:22.080
I want to be close to
him more than anybody...

13:23.270 --> 13:26.740
...but I feel like nothing
has changed since then.

13:30.660 --> 13:36.920
It looks like he has a tendency to be
distant with his friends, don't you think?

13:38.920 --> 13:40.380
Yayoi!

13:40.380 --> 13:41.630
Y-Yuiko!

13:41.630 --> 13:44.390
How can I get closer to him?

13:44.390 --> 13:45.890
Tell me!

13:45.890 --> 13:46.810
What?

13:46.810 --> 13:49.300
Yuiko is so sad...

13:50.640 --> 13:52.550
I want to cry too...

13:54.120 --> 13:57.410
Sentou system, on. I declare
this to be a battle of spells.

13:57.770 --> 14:01.140
Man, this guy gets on my nerves.

14:01.140 --> 14:02.100
We accept.

14:02.100 --> 14:03.760
I declare this to be a battle of spells.

14:07.070 --> 14:07.820
Ignite!

14:08.790 --> 14:12.960
Attack with scorching flames,
temperature of 10,000 degrees Celsius!

14:14.080 --> 14:15.120
Defense.

14:17.710 --> 14:20.750
The heat will not reach. Zero damage.

14:20.750 --> 14:23.210
No! Damage will be 100 percent!

14:29.010 --> 14:31.180
Flames, disappear! It'll be zero!

14:32.140 --> 14:34.640
There exists nothing in
this space that can burn.

14:37.650 --> 14:40.690
Well, he's good...

14:41.280 --> 14:43.230
He copies your style.

14:43.230 --> 14:44.320
That's nasty!

14:45.200 --> 14:47.240
But he's on the defense.

14:48.490 --> 14:50.820
We can crush that kind of defense!

14:50.820 --> 14:52.780
He doesn't even have a Sacrifice...

14:52.780 --> 14:55.410
He's unbelievable!

14:55.750 --> 14:57.890
How can he change his Sacrifice?

14:57.890 --> 14:59.910
I can't believe it's his second one!

14:59.910 --> 15:01.090
Die!

15:01.090 --> 15:03.500
When your Sacrifice
dies, you should die too!

15:03.500 --> 15:05.090
Die! Die! Die!

15:06.130 --> 15:08.590
Kouya, I know!

15:09.180 --> 15:11.390
But concentrate on
your attacks right now...

15:13.810 --> 15:16.070
The Zero series have no sense of pain.

15:16.690 --> 15:20.350
That means it's useless
to give them only pain.

15:20.820 --> 15:23.110
I must apply damage that
stops their body's functions...

15:23.280 --> 15:25.360
Tear your limbs apart, four folds!

15:31.870 --> 15:34.030
Five bodies will be torn
apart with five folds!

15:37.960 --> 15:38.580
Yamato!

15:42.170 --> 15:46.050
People say damaging a girl's face
is the worst thing you can do.

15:46.050 --> 15:47.420
Well, not to me.

15:48.090 --> 15:51.090
Sorry, I didn't have the time to think.

15:52.010 --> 15:56.210
Fangs of ice, freezing
wind, droplets of subzero...

15:59.190 --> 16:02.190
Kouya! He's trying to
lower the temperature!

16:02.980 --> 16:04.460
Zero change of temperature.

16:04.460 --> 16:07.770
Our body temperature
will maintain.

16:08.410 --> 16:11.740
I see, it won't work on them.

16:12.200 --> 16:14.740
I found Agatsuma's weakness!

16:16.370 --> 16:18.700
Injured? I can tell
you're protecting it.

16:19.790 --> 16:24.500
Your left hand...
and your left arm...

16:24.920 --> 16:25.580
Tear it apart!

16:32.890 --> 16:33.840
Shatter!

16:49.780 --> 16:52.020
Soubi doesn't answer no
matter how many times I call...

16:52.570 --> 16:55.360
Come on, where are you?

17:00.580 --> 17:01.990
What's wrong?

17:01.990 --> 17:03.750
No counterattack?

17:11.340 --> 17:15.040
This is kinda getting tiresome.

17:16.180 --> 17:18.720
We're not done even if you say that...

17:22.480 --> 17:23.950
I wasn't told to win...

17:24.420 --> 17:27.920
Nobody ordered me to fight...

17:29.450 --> 17:31.820
We told you this is a lynching.

17:42.170 --> 17:44.620
If you want to, go ahead.

17:47.130 --> 17:49.470
Nothingness. Absolutely zero.

17:50.050 --> 17:53.270
Limbs will turn into
pieces, and return to zero.

17:54.340 --> 17:55.860
Crumble!

18:00.430 --> 18:02.980
Natsuo, telephone, telephone!

18:02.980 --> 18:04.430
Huh? Yeah...

18:04.430 --> 18:07.150
Answer it! It could be
from Professor Nagisa!

18:07.150 --> 18:08.320
Okay, okay.

18:09.030 --> 18:10.690
Hello?

18:11.490 --> 18:13.350
What?

18:14.530 --> 18:15.190
Who's that?

18:16.950 --> 18:18.420
From Soubi...

18:18.950 --> 18:21.330
He was out of breath,
then it got disconnected.

18:21.330 --> 18:22.660
What the hell is that?

18:31.720 --> 18:33.670
I think he's around here...

18:39.060 --> 18:40.420
Answer, Soubi...

18:41.430 --> 18:42.340
Answer!

18:42.740 --> 18:44.430
Answer the phone! Stupid Soubi!

18:49.720 --> 18:53.320
Natsuo? Please, I can't move...

18:54.200 --> 18:55.120
Soubi?

18:57.450 --> 18:58.450
Ritsuka...

18:58.450 --> 19:01.330
I bet you were thinking
'oh crap!', weren't you?

19:01.330 --> 19:02.700
Don't hang up!

19:03.050 --> 19:04.990
Don't you dare hang up!
I'll kill you if you do!

19:07.420 --> 19:09.960
Is that an order?

19:10.920 --> 19:12.720
Yes, it's an order!

19:13.130 --> 19:14.920
I'll be right there!

19:17.550 --> 19:21.070
Ritsuka... I don't want to see you...

19:22.560 --> 19:24.020
I don't want you to see me...

19:29.230 --> 19:30.300
Soubi!

19:30.300 --> 19:32.080
Soubi! Soubi!

19:32.690 --> 19:34.020
Get a hold of yourself!

19:40.330 --> 19:41.360
Ritsuka...

19:42.660 --> 19:43.780
Don't look at me.

19:45.710 --> 19:47.950
Did you fight again on your own?

19:48.580 --> 19:49.710
Are you stupid?

19:49.710 --> 19:51.010
Look at you...

19:51.010 --> 19:52.780
Why didn't you call me?

19:52.780 --> 19:54.630
Always going behind my back!

19:54.630 --> 19:57.330
Why do you always betray me?

19:57.330 --> 19:59.860
You weren't going to fight by yourself...

20:00.470 --> 20:02.680
Didn't you promise that with me?

20:05.980 --> 20:06.600
Sorry.

20:09.700 --> 20:10.820
Enough!

20:11.320 --> 20:13.060
I'll listen to all of it later...

20:13.280 --> 20:14.310
Can you stand up?

20:16.780 --> 20:17.730
I can't...

20:17.730 --> 20:18.950
Shut up!

20:24.750 --> 20:25.780
Damn it!

20:32.790 --> 20:33.700
Sorry...

20:34.870 --> 20:35.960
Are you okay?

20:53.190 --> 20:55.490
Am I no good to you?

20:58.710 --> 21:01.690
I'm not as useful as Seimei?

21:05.120 --> 21:07.220
Is that why you don't call me?

21:15.210 --> 21:17.340
Soubi, what's wrong?

21:17.340 --> 21:18.380
Hang in there!

21:18.550 --> 21:19.550
Soubi!

21:29.510 --> 21:34.430
To be continued...

21:30.390 --> 21:39.940
Setsunasa no kagiri made dakishimete mo

21:30.390 --> 21:39.940
Even if I hold you with all my suffering,

21:40.820 --> 21:50.330
itsu made mo hitotsu ni wa narenakute

21:40.820 --> 21:50.330
we still can't be one.

21:50.910 --> 22:00.840
Yasashisa yori fukai basho de fureau no wa itami dake

21:50.910 --> 22:00.840
The only thing that we can feel deep within besides kindness is pain,

22:01.250 --> 22:08.840
futari wo musunde kudasai

22:01.250 --> 22:08.840
so please, bind the two of us together.

22:11.390 --> 22:16.230
Bokura wa mou yume wo minai

22:11.390 --> 22:16.230
We no longer dream anymore,

22:16.230 --> 22:21.360
tomadoinagara te wo totte

22:16.230 --> 22:21.360
when you're wavering, take my hand

22:21.650 --> 22:30.570
zankoku na yoake no hou e arukidasu

22:21.650 --> 22:30.570
as we tread towards the cruel light of dawn.

22:31.700 --> 22:41.710
Hontou no kotoba wa kitto hontou no sekai no dokoka

22:31.700 --> 22:41.710
I'm sure real words are somewhere in the real world.

22:42.040 --> 22:50.930
Bokura no mukuchi na yoru ni hisonderu

22:42.040 --> 22:50.930
They lurk in the shadows of our silent nights.

22:51.300 --> 22:56.430
Ima mo kitto

22:51.300 --> 22:56.430
Surely, even now...

23:00.980 --> 23:03.600
Ritsuka, sorry.

23:03.600 --> 23:04.860
Why?

23:05.180 --> 23:06.750
You gave me the cell phone!

23:07.410 --> 23:08.540
Sorry...

23:08.540 --> 23:11.280
Why do you ignore me on purpose?

23:12.370 --> 23:13.290
Sorry...

23:13.290 --> 23:15.790
Why is everything a secret?

23:16.160 --> 23:18.910
Tale nine, Skinless.

23:18.910 --> 23:22.750
This skin that divides
me and you is in the way!
